<title>BRAZIL: Brazil August unemployment falls slightly - IBGE.</title>
<headline>Brazil August unemployment falls slightly - IBGE.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's August unemployment rate fell slightly to 5.56 percent from 5.58 percent in July, the National Statistics Institute (IBGE) said.</p>
<p>August is the third consecutive month in which the unemployment rate was lower than the previous month, the IBGE said in a statement.</p>
<p>Unemployment increased, however, when compared with August 1995 when the rate stood at 4.9 percent, the IBGE said.</p>
</text>
